            {
              "content": "=You are a senior recruiter evaluating a job applicant's form submission. \nScore this lead out of 10 based on the information provided.\nReturn ONLY this JSON, no extra text:\n\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 0-10,\n  \"score_breakdown\": {\n    \"work_experience\": 0-10,\n    \"key_skills\": 0-10,\n    \"motivation\": 0-10,\n    \"availability\": 0-10,\n    \"salary_expectation\": 0-10,\n    \"location_fit\": 0-10,\n    \"portfolio_provided\": 0-10\n  },\n  \"summary\": \"2-3 sentences on why this lead scored the way it did\",\n  \"green_flags\": [\"positive signal 1\", \"positive signal 2\"],\n  \"red_flags\": [\"concern 1, or null if none\"],\n  \"recommendation\": \"High Priority\" or \"Follow Up\" or \"Pass\"\n}\n\nHere is the applicant's submission:\n\nName: {{ $json.name_applicant }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone_applicant }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company_applicant }}\nLocation: {{ $json.body.location }}\nWork Experience: {{ $json['work_experience '] }}\nKey Skills: {{ $json.body.key_skills }}\nAvailability: {{ $json.body.availability }}\nMotivation: {{ $json.body.motivation }}\n\nExpected Salary:{{ $json.body.expected_salary }}\n\nScore strictly and fairly. If critical fields like work experience, \nskills or motivation contain vague or gibberish responses, \npenalize heavily in the score. A portfolio link being present \nshould positively impact the score."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
