        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"token\": \"bq149cekkmcm3sfp\",\n  \"to\": \"{{ $json.candidate_phone }}\",\n  \"body\": \"Hello {{ $json.candidate_name }}, this is Kie from Recruit AI. You have been shortlisted by {{ $json.candidate_company }} for the {{ $json.role }} role.\\n\\nI'll be asking you a few questions to take this forward and see if you are good fit for the next interview round\"\n}",
